<title>FRANCE: Bollore Technologies 1996 sales up.</title>
<headline>Bollore Technologies 1996 sales up.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-02-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>(All figures in millions of French francs)</p>
<p>    Turnover					22,159    vs   21,837</p>
